        <div class="closing">
          <p>Seven interviews is a small sample for product UX research and a real sample for formative evaluation. The bridge between the two is what the research was designed to find — not what users wanted in the abstract, but what their daily work actually required of any system that hoped to land. The methodology travels across industries. The patience for listening is what's harder to find.</p>
          <p class="cta">Hiring for a research role where this method and mindset would land? I'd love to talk.</p>
        </div>

